From: =?UTF-8?q?=E6=8E=A0=E8=93=9D?= <469906100@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:56:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] fix(gitattributes): keep node scripts, patches and
 Docker/Make files LF
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

取证：全新 worktree 检出后 scripts/verify-compat.mjs 有 180 个 CR、
patches/channel-daily-limit.patch 有 1067 个 CR（*.mjs/*.cjs/*.patch 未被
上游 .gitattributes 覆盖）。这类文件在 Windows 上被转成 CRLF 后，node ESM
脚本可能报语法错误，git apply 也会看到多余空白——只有在升级当天才暴露。
---
 .gitattributes | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitattributes b/.gitattributes
index ff3551d53..1ca313594 100644
--- a/.gitattributes
+++ b/.gitattributes
@@ -22,6 +22,15 @@
 # Shell scripts
 *.sh text eol=lf
 
+# Executed or applied verbatim: a CRLF checkout breaks node ESM scripts and
+# makes git apply see bogus trailing whitespace.
+*.mjs text eol=lf
+*.cjs text eol=lf
+*.patch text eol=lf
+Dockerfile* text eol=lf
+Makefile* text eol=lf
+*.example text eol=lf
+
 # Binary files
 *.png binary
 *.jpg binary
-- 
2.53.0.windows.2

